      "sourceText": "这个计数按进入保存分支的扫描处理次数增加。例如稳定20 Hz且每帧正常处理时，100次约为5秒，但 interval 本身不是时间参数。本地仅在 interval>0 时分批保存，0及其他负值也不会触发周期保存，使用默认特殊值 -1 更清楚。",
      "translatedText": "This count increases according to the number of scan processing times that enter the save branch\\. For example, at a stable 20 Hz with normal processing per frame, 100 times is about 5 seconds, but interval itself is not a time parameter\\. Locally, saving is performed in batches only when interval \\> 0; 0 and other negative values also do not trigger periodic saving, and using the default special value \\-1 is clearer\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
